# 4. VULNERABILITY → EXPLOIT → PAYLOAD

This is one of the most important exam concepts.

### Vulnerability

A weakness.

```text
Weakness
```

### Exploit

A method/code that takes advantage of the weakness.

```text
Weakness → Exploit
```

### Payload

The action/code delivered through the exploit.

```text
Exploit → Payload
```

### Memory

> **Vulnerability = Weakness**  
> **Exploit = Entry**  
> **Payload = Action**

