# 25. REVERSE SHELL IS NOT PERSISTENCE

Suppose:

```text
Target
 ↓
Reverse Shell
 ↓
Reboot
 ↓
Session disappears
```

That is not persistence.

Persistence would involve an authorized mechanism that causes access/execution to remain available after the interruption.

