# 50. EXPLOITATION TROUBLESHOOTING FRAMEWORK

When an authorized lab exploit does not work:

```text
1. TARGET
   ↓
2. SERVICE
   ↓
3. VERSION
   ↓
4. VULNERABILITY
   ↓
5. MODULE
   ↓
6. OPTIONS
   ↓
7. PAYLOAD
   ↓
8. NETWORK
   ↓
9. MITIGATIONS
   ↓
10. LOGS
```

Ask:

> **Did I correctly identify the target?**

> **Is the vulnerable service actually running?**

> **Does the exploit apply to this exact version/configuration?**

> **Are my lab options correct?**

> **Is a security mitigation blocking the behavior?**

