# 51. PROFESSIONAL EXPLOITATION RULE

Never think:

> "I found an exploit, so I should run it."

Think:

```text
Is it authorized?
       ↓
Is it in scope?
       ↓
Is it necessary?
       ↓
What is the potential impact?
       ↓
Can it be safely validated?
       ↓
What evidence do I need?
       ↓
How will I restore the system?
```

